'''Visitors''' are [[NPC]]s across [[SkyBlock]] that occasionally visit the [[player]]'s [[Garden]]. They offer the [[player]] a trade in exchange for {{skl|farming|XP}}, {{skl|garden|XP}}, {{Copper}}, {{Bits}}, and sometimes other unique rewards. '''Visitors''' will stay in the [[Garden]] until the player accepts or declines their offer. 

There are {{Green|140}} <!-- SB version 0.24.5--> unique '''visitors''' currently available.

==Visitors==
A maximum of {{Green|5}} '''Visitors''' can be on the [[Garden]] at one time. If the [[player]] is on the [[Garden]], a 6th '''Visitor''' will queue up and stay hidden until a current one is accepted or declined. Each '''Visitor''' has a {{Skl|Garden}} level requirement, as well as sometimes other requirements, which must be met before they can visit the player's [[Garden]]. However, all requirements except for [[Garden]] Level are disabled on the {{Gamemode|Stranded}} game mode. '''Visitors''' can visit multiple times.

NPCs that can visit the Garden are listed in the table below.
<br>
{{/List}}

=== Visitor's Logbook ===
The '''Visitor's Logbook''' keeps track of who has visited the player's [[Garden]], and requirements for NPCs to visit. It shows how many time each '''Visitor''' has visited the player's [[Garden]] and how many time the player has accepted each '''Visitor'''.

=== Visitor Milestones ===
'''Visitor Milestones''' can be viewed in the '''Desk'''. There are 2 types of '''Visitor Milestones''':
*'''Unique Visitors Served''', which increases based on the amount of offers from unique Visitors the player has accepted.
*'''Offers Accepted''', which increases based on the amount of offers from '''Visitors''' the player has accepted.
Both grant {{Skl|Garden|XP}}, {{Skl|Farming|XP}}, and {{SkyBlock XP}} when milestones are reached.

