==Requests==
{{Outdated|Multipliers for Carrot, Cocoa Beans, and Mushroom are likely outdated after the recipe changes. Moonflower, Sunflower, and Wild Rose are missing.|section=y}}
When visiting, '''Visitors''' will request varying amounts of certain items. Some '''Visitors''' will always request items crafted from a certain crop, or other specific items. Other '''Visitors''' will request any crop, or multiple types of items.

Base items is first decided by the number of raw items in the '''Visitor's''' request, which are then compacted into higher tiers as many times as possible. If the amount of remaining materials that cannot be compacted is less than {{Green|10%}} of the raw items, then the amount of compacted items will be increased by 1.

The quantity of the items that a Visitor requests is determined by this formula:<br>
<math>\text{Quantity} = \text{BaseQuantity} \times \text{ItemQuantityMultiplier} \times \text{VisitorRarityMultiplier}</math>

