The quantity of the items that the {{NPCSprite|Spaceman}} requests is determined by the amount of that item that sells to an NPC for as close to {{C|1B}} as possible.

==Rewards==
'''Visitors''' offer {{skl|farming|XP}}, {{skl|garden|XP}}, {{Copper}}, and {{Bits}} to the player if they accept the '''Visitor's''' request. [[#List of Visitors|Certain '''Visitors''']] will also give unique rewards to the player and override the amount of {{Skl|Farming|XP}} and {{Copper}} given as rewards.

=== Farming XP ===
{{Skl|Farming|XP}} is determined with this formula: <math>FarmingXP = BaseItems \times ItemFarmingXP \times VisitorRarityMultiplier</math>{{Confirm}} (<math>BaseItems</math> is from the [[#Requests|Requests]] formula)<br>
<math>VisitorRarityMultiplier</math> is determined by the '''Visitor's''' Rarity:
* {{Rarity|u|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×0.05}}
* {{Rarity|r|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×0.06}}
* {{Rarity|l|nolink=y}} and above: {{Green|×0.75}}

=== Garden XP ===
{{Skl|Garden|XP}} is determined with this formula: <math>GardenXP = GardenLevelXP \times VisitorRarityMultiplier</math><br>
<math>GardenLevelXP</math> is determined by the player's {{Skl|Garden}} level:
{| class="wikitable centertext"
! {{Skl|Garden|Level}}
| {{Green|1}} || {{Green|2}} || {{Green|3}} || {{Green|4}} || {{Green|5}} || {{Green|6}} || {{Green|7}} || {{Green|8}} || {{Green|9}} || {{Green|10}} || {{Green|11}} || {{Green|12}} || {{Green|13}} || {{Green|14}} || {{Green|15}}
|-
! {{Skl|Garden|XP}}
| {{Green|+2}} || {{Green|+3}} || {{Green|+3}} || {{Green|+4}} || {{Green|+5}} || {{Green|+6}} || {{Green|+8}} || {{Green|+10}} || {{Green|+12}} || {{Green|+15}} || {{Green|+15}} || {{Green|+15}} || {{Green|+15}} || {{Green|+15}} || {{Green|+15}}
|}

The {{Skl|Garden|XP}} is then multiplied by <math>VisitorRarityMultiplier</math>, which is determined by the '''Visitor's''' Rarity:
* {{Uncommon|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×1}}
* {{Rare|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×2}}
* {{Legendary|nolink=y}} and above: {{Green|×5}}

=== Copper ===
{{Copper}} is determined with this formula: <math>Copper = \frac{\frac{BaseItems}{2000}}{ItemQuantityMultiplier} \times VisitorRarityMultiplier \times 1.3</math> (<math>BaseItems</math> and <math>ItemQuantityMultiplier</math> are from the [[#Requests|Requests]] formula)<br>
<math>VisitorRarityMultiplier</math> is determined by the '''Visitor's''' Rarity:
* {{Uncommon|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×1}}
* {{Rare|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×1}}
* {{Legendary|nolink=y}} and above{{confirm}}: {{Green|×5}}
A visitor will always give the player at least {{Copper|2}}.

If the player has given a [[Fungal Tip Jar]] to {{NPCSprite|Sam}}, accepting a '''Visitor''' has a {{green|75%}} chance for the '''Visitor''' to tip {{Red|2-5}} {{Copper}} on top of their regular rewards which the Player can collect later.

=== Bits ===
{{Bits}} is set at 5 bits, and is then affected by the player's [[Fame Ranks|Fame]] rank {{Bits}} multiplier. This is not affected by visitor rarity or garden level. 

