===Charming Visitors===
'''Visitors''' can be charmed using a {{Item|Carrot-Colored Vinyl Set}}. Charming a vistor rewards the player with a {{Item|Visitors' Gratitude}}, used to craft the [[Gratitude Talisman]] accessory line, and boosts other rewards.

Charming Visitors guarantees the following:<ref name="charming-effects"/>
* {{Item|Visitors' Gratitude|amount=1}}
* {{Green|1.5x}} {{Copper}}
* {{Green|3x}} chance for the following items:
** {{Item|Hypercharge Chip}}
** {{Item|Quickdraw Chip}}
** {{Item|Flowering Bouquet}}
** {{Item|Overgrown Grass}}
** {{Item|Green Bandana}}
** {{Item|Fruit Bowl}}
** {{Item|Copper Dye}}
** {{Item|Enchanted Book|enchant=Dedication IV}} ({{NPCSprite|Librarian}} only)
