Additionally, gifting a [[Carrot-Colored Vinyl Set]] to {{NPCSprite|Jacob}} or {{NPCSprite|Spaceman}} awards a {{Item|Farming Contest Display}} or {{Item|Astronaut Minion Skin}} respectively.

